<title>UK: Rank unit pays $61 mln for Canada Hard Rock.</title>
<headline>Rank unit pays $61 mln for Canada Hard Rock.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rank Group Plc said on Tuesday that its subsidiary, Hard Rock Cafe International, had acquired the operations and licensing rights of Hard Rock Cafe Canada for $61 million.  </p>
<p>Hard Rock Cafe Canada was owned by the Bitove family. The Canadian operations included three owned cafes and eight franchise cafes in Canada, Rank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The Canadian restaurants would be renovated and converted to conform to its Hard Rock Cafe style and format, Rank said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
